？　世界一白い塗料がギネス記録に　太陽光の98.1％を反射","id":1,"title":"塗るだけで表面が冷える？　世界一白い塗料がギネス記録に　太陽光の98.1％を反射","title_link":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html","text":"米パデュー大学の研究チームが開発した白い塗料が、世界で最も白い塗料としてギネス記録に認定された。この塗料は地球温暖化を抑制することを目的に開発されたもので、この塗料を塗った部分は、周囲よりも冷えるという。","thumb_url":"https://image.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/cover_news157.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"ITmedia NEWS","service_icon":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":800,"thumb_height":450,"from_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html","original_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dC3O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3501b3b-fa62-4430-ba59-491636d10fe5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あと似たような考えのもので、電球の内壁に可視は通すけど赤外は反射する膜を蒸着したらエネルギー効率よくなるんじゃね？っていう原理のものがあったはず","ts":"1634368665.093500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ds"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c122c3c7-b928-403f-955a-9fabe484cb47","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おー、すごい","ts":"1634368315.091400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"13Cg="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b92bfdee-79ae-4daf-9837-2d199bb632f7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"日が当たり始めてから数時間でガッツリかわる","ts":"1634368292.091100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83f8c5c3-af0f-4e13-9fe1-4d4184e4e2e3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://news.mynavi.jp/article/20171020-lava_tubes/\u003e","ts":"1634368283.090700","attachments":[{"fallback":"TECH+: 月探査機「かぐや」、月に巨大な地下空洞を発見 - さらなる探査に期待膨らむ (1)","id":1,"title":"月探査機「かぐや」、月に巨大な地下空洞を発見 - さらなる探査に期待膨らむ (1)","title_link":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20171020-lava_tubes/","text":"宇宙航空研究開発機構(JAXA)は2017年10月18日、月の地下に長さ約50kmにもおよぶ巨大な空洞があることが判明したと発表した。日本の月探査機「かぐや」の観測データを解析していた国際共同研究チームが発見したもので、論文は同日、米科学誌『Geophysical Research Letters』に掲載された。","image_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20171020-lava_tubes/index_images/index.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1508450400,"service_name":"TECH+","service_icon":"https://news.mynavi.jp/images/techplus/favicon_techplus.ico","from_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20171020-lava_tubes/","original_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20171020-lava_tubes/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jNr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d09ef0b-8d88-40cb-ab43-b16a0afced2a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"↑の図3が知りたかった答えなのでは","ts":"1634368245.090000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kDZC/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26a55db8-e719-4c7f-afbf-36881701c35a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ最外部からの放熱で平衝になっちゃうから、それでもどれだけだろうというのはあるけど...\n今は、月の地下トンネルでの温度保持の話題くらいはあるかな?\n(熱源は人間ので十分かなという)","ts":"1634368209.089500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"in+3z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14a4f01e-2612-4861-8c76-e7870f08af8f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://www.google.com/url?sa=t\u0026amp;source=web\u0026amp;rct=j\u0026amp;url=https://www.asj.or.jp/jsession/old/2012haru/15_jsession2012.pdf\u0026amp;ved=2ahUKEwiaoKrJr87zAhWJdd4KHZGJB9wQFnoECA8QAQ\u0026amp;usg=AOvVaw2Cqeqop9HXgKnTVAN_Lzl4|https://www.google.com/url?sa=t\u0026amp;source=web\u0026amp;rct=j\u0026amp;url=https://www.asj.or.jp/jsession/old/2012haru/15_jsession2012.pdf\u0026amp;ved=2ahUKEwiaoKrJr87zAhWJdd4KHZGJB9wQFnoECA8QAQ\u0026amp;usg=AOvVaw2Cqeqop9HXgKnTVAN_Lzl4\u003e","ts":"1634368208.089300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kK5"}]},{"client