_id":"adcca066-2a2a-4cae-a9bc-bd279777337e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"月の「一日」の温度変化が気になりますねw","ts":"1634367905.083700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0O2l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41c125dc-ac4a-4b17-8293-33a6e33ab0e5","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E3%83%9E%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E6%B3%A2%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E6%94%BE%E5%B0%84\u003e これかあ","ts":"1634367866.082900","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: 宇宙マイクロ波背景放射","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"宇宙マイクロ波背景放射","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E3%83%9E%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E6%B3%A2%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E6%94%BE%E5%B0%84","text":"宇宙マイクロ波背景放射（うちゅうマイクロははいけいほうしゃ、cosmic microwave background ; CMB）とは、天球上の全方向からほぼ等方的に観測されるマイクロ波である。そのスペクトルは2.725Kの黒体放射に極めてよく一致している。\n単に宇宙背景放射 (cosmic background radiation; CBR)、マイクロ波背景放射 (microwave background radiation; MBR) 等とも言う。黒体放射温度から3K背景放射、3K放射とも言う。宇宙マイクロ波背景輻射、宇宙背景輻射などとも言う（輻射は放射の同義語）。","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Cmbr.svg/1200px-Cmbr.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E3%83%9E%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E6%B3%A2%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E6%94%BE%E5%B0%84","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E3%83%9E%E3%82%A4%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E6%B3%A2%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E6%94%BE%E5%B0%84"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z01j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9918fd9d-c468-4a32-973b-6a66666ef5ba","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"CMBが2.75Kか","ts":"1634367842.082700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v1yOp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4fb9f34c-4586-43ef-beee-205956206534","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最後は背景放射の温度までですが、まあ月だとそこまでいく前に日にあたりますからね...","ts":"1634367793.082100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"df+A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"053714bb-9358-492c-8e22-ebd2b51fe249","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なるほどなあ","ts":"1634367778.081700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QK/E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dff0094-45ed-4599-ae3b-76c59b7b8a32","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"赤外スペクトルの電磁場温度まで下がろうとするんじゃないかな","ts":"1634367734.081200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uTr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09217ecf-24c7-4c75-8e73-521453f0f39b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":eyes:","ts":"1634367679.080000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2VX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d62602a8-5b77-4280-8ab9-59215b14d806","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"宇宙物理は未履修ですが2.7Kと言われているようです\n\u003chttps://www.tel.co.jp/museum/magazine/news/272.html|https://www.tel.co.jp/museum/magazine/news/272.html\u003e","ts":"1634367668.079700","attachments":[{"fallback":"nanotec museum: 宇宙で最も冷たいスポットを創り出す","id":1,"title":"宇宙で最も冷たいスポットを創り出す","title_link":"https://www.tel.co.jp/museum/magazine/news/272.html","text":"ナノテクノロジーと半導体技術が可能にする未来はどのような世界なのか。最前線で活躍する研究者やプロジェクトを取材し、未来社会の風景を先取りしてお届けします。","image_url":"https://www.tel.co.jp/museum/magazine/news/img/topimg_news272_01.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"nanotec museum","service_icon":"https://www.tel.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.tel.co.jp/museum/magazine/news/272.html","original_url":"https://www.tel.co.jp/museum/magazine/news/272.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xQmnh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"577298ed-a914-4007-bc9b-407aea0f66ec","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"宇宙空間の温度はほぼnilと考えると、この場合無制限に出し続ける、つまり絶対零度に近いところまでいくというわけかあ","ts":"1634367628.078700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uDD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1973e5db-6e84-4889-8190-1d5a16371392","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いくんじゃないですか？輻射で放出先の空間と同じ温度になろうとするなら、宇宙空間と熱平衡になろうとしてるわけで","ts":"1634367572.077700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z=7t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afb67aec-1bf1-4a51-9588-ca0bd339f9b3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"直感的には真空状態だと熱移動がないのでかなり不思議な感覚","ts":"1634367558.077300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wSt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41cc2a12-26dd-4b07-8cbc-b512a270ea4b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"輻射で-180とかまでさがるものなのか...!","ts":"1634367519.076000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MXv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"854d7868-2e02-44e4-8e73-07a69148ffb2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"下側は-20Cということは表面は下側よりさらに冷たいことになる","ts":"1634367500.075500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i6vun"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36b3159f-90be-4740-b61d-65818dfa04f5","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"謎がさらにふかまってしまった","ts":"1634367477.075100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cRn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"102db9d7-3ba3-451e-82c8-531d2e861f68","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"てことは輻射がメインなのかな","ts":"1634367458.074700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3oZt4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfb5b1c6-6230-4f23-8aaf-0e9a290503d7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"へえ〜","ts":"1634367436.074100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iz6d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3606c66-2419-4c8b-bd66-2176b4273554","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね、高温から常温(?)まではかなりはやそう","ts":"1634367413.073900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Z="}]},{"client_msg_id":"c49753d8-afd8-4425-a5ea-8bc9e1b7b7d9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"高いとき200℃超えなら赤外光はたくさんだしてそうですね","ts":"1634367393.073500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GUgux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93182959-a613-4cf0-8c33-acf37d62626d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://jaxa.repo.nii.ac.jp/?action=repository_action_common_download\u0026amp;item_id=41111\u0026amp;item_no=1\u0026amp;attribute_id=31\u0026amp;file_no=1\u003e\nおっ\n\u003chttps://gyazo.com/0da5caf9e343d2ea02e809e242b37bfe\u003e","ts":"1634367379.072900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Gyazo Photo: ","id":1,"title_link":"https://gyazo.com/0da5caf9e343d2ea02e809e242b37bfe","image_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/0da5caf9e343d2ea02e809e242b37bfe.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Gyazo","service_icon":"https://gyazo.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://gyazo.com/0da5caf9e343d2ea02e809e242b37bfe","original_url":"https://gyazo.com/0da5caf9e343d2ea02e809e242b37bfe"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V8lD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a44f6fea-b7f8-4e98-805e-39d1202b3b60","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":shinkuroritsu:","ts":"1634367287.071200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OfAn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e07c4dd0-ab72-4115-bda0-bf43ff0119f0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"月の一日は一月なので（なんだこの文","ts":"1634367279.070800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v9Uv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4a33150-7d2c-4816-88eb-ae9b2b237ef9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"今ひとつ気づいたけど月の一日がそもそも地球での一ヶ月みたいに長いんですね。もしかしたら時間をかけてゆっくり熱移動していたのかもしれない","ts":"1634367267.070500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H/YY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83108848-826d-495d-922a-0772adbbda9a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なるほど輻射。表土自体は遠赤外線発光しなさそうなので考慮に入れてなかった。このあたりどうなんだろう","ts":"1634367224.069100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9SE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c66b8e86-4b55-4bc7-b710-9a829d753b7e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"輻射の寄与では","ts":"1634367099.068100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HxQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce90f922-6715-41b3-9609-604b31586ffa","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"真空化では熱移動が発生しない、つまり熱が月の内側に移動するため冷えることになるけど、表土がそこまで熱伝導率高いのかなあ","ts":"1634366787.067500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Ri"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0c44df6-f36a-4439-bda5-3be055b053ee","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"月の表面温度、昼間はめちゃくちゃ熱くて夜はめちゃくちゃ寒いのが定説だけど、大気がないのにどうやって冷えるんだろう","ts":"1634366696.066600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Erov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cb47afe-013f-4385-b72a-0ccb4c68aa91","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ふと気になってきた","ts":"1634366675.066000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BR5"}]}]
